Third-party benchmarks and models
---------------------------------
This repository does not redistribute benchmark data. Loaders in `tabagent.datasets` download each
source from its upstream location at a pinned revision into a local cache, subject to its own license:

  * tau2-bench (sierra-research/tau2-bench) ............ MIT
  * tau2-sft-final (Hugging Face dataset) ............... Apache-2.0
  * SkillsBench (benchflow-ai/skillsbench and the
    benchflow/skillsbench-leaderboard dataset) ......... Apache-2.0
  * Mind2Web (osunlp/Mind2Web) .......................... CC-BY-4.0 (attribution required)
  * LLMRouterBench ...................................... MIT, as declared in the upstream README (the
                                                          repository ships no LICENSE file); opt-in download
  * AppWorld ............................................ Apache-2.0 with an encrypted-redistribution
                                                          condition; obtained only via the official CLI
  * intfloat/e5-small-v2 (text encoder) ................. MIT
  * CatBoost ............................................ Apache-2.0

Models downloaded by the paper-reproduction scripts in `experiments/` (not by the package), each under its
own license:

  * Llama 3.1 8B Instruct and Llama 3.2 1B/3B Instruct .. Llama 3.1 / Llama 3.2 Community License
  * Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct ................................. Apache-2.0
  * TabSTAR (optional head of the head ablation) ........ MIT (code), CC-BY-4.0 (pretrained weights)

